274
00:14:09,390 --> 00:14:12,071
He was stopped by one outsider willing to

275
00:14:12,130 --> 00:14:14,591
bring the right equipment into the room and

276
00:14:14,650 --> 00:14:17,610
treat an extraordinary claim as something that could

277
00:14:17,690 --> 00:14:21,051
actually be tested, not mocked, not simply

278
00:14:21,110 --> 00:14:22,930
