279
00:14:23,490 --> 00:14:26,490
Skepticism applied carefully enough to produce

280
00:14:26,571 --> 00:14:29,530
evidence instead of just doubt is still the

281
00:14:29,630 --> 00:14:32,430
only thing in this entire story that actually

282
00:14:32,490 --> 00:14:35,311
worked. So the next time something feels like

283
00:14:35,391 --> 00:14:38,751
a miracle of knowledge, remember, Popoff's audience

284
00:14:38,891 --> 00:14:41,812
